<svg class="dg dg--drsi" viewBox="0 0 1200 450" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">

{#- DiscoveryRSI, left to right: a research question grows a hypothesis tree
    through the four actions; the selected hypothesis (the amber point) is
    compiled into a Harbor task; every step is kept in the research record;
    the record feeds hypothesis credit optimization (the model) and harness
    replay (the workflow); updates that pass the development check go into
    rediscovery, and the loop returns to fresh questions along the floor. -#}

